            </note>
            <note corresp="#d257-f3" n="5" xml:id="d257-f3-content">
                <p>See telegram No. 1272, October 19, 1939, 2 p.m., to the Ambassador in France,
                        <ref target="frus1939v01#pg_642">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, p. 642</ref>.</p>
            </note>
